1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,420
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Carla was getting ready for school.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,780
She grabbed a pink sock.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,260
She tried to find the other one.

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,000
It should be easy to find.

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,000
Pink stands out.

6
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:15,020
Especially amongst white socks.

7
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,420
She could not find it though.

8
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,100
She checked under her bed.

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,780
She checked in the washing machine.

10
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,560
She checked in the dryer.

11
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,480
She checked in the dirty clothes basket.

12
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,740
She could not find it anywhere.

13
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:36,260
She asked her mom if she saw her

14
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,060
pink sock.

15
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:41,040
Just wear a white sock and long jeans,

16
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,280
her mom said.

17
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,400
That was a good idea.

18
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:47,480
It did not matter if her socks matched,

19
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,400
if no one could see her socks.

20
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,960
She took out a white sock.

21
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,860
She wore it on her left foot.

22
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,460
She was ready for school.
